{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"You can activate your survival defense mechanism and push beyond your normal limits, causing you to become faster. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- On your turn, you can trigger a rush of adrenaline within yourself (no action required). You can take one additional action only to Dash, and your movement speed increases by 15 feet until the end of your turn. During your movement in this turn, you don’t provoke opportunity attacks. Once you have used this feat, you can\u0027t use it again until you finish a short or long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Custom89cfde50-cb6f-4085-9b67-cfcabc086e1b","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Adrenaline Rusher [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}